WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.110
(soft music)

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:03.090
- [Host] This map shows the maximum range

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:07.080
of China's land-based conventional
strike missiles in 2015.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.520
Less than a decade later,

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.490
that range has doubled,
putting all American bases

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:14.405
in the Asia Pacific, including
Guam within the range

00:00:14.405 --> 00:00:18.150
of precision missiles fired
from the Chinese mainland.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.700
A secretive Chinese
military unit is responsible

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.441
for that expansion, and now
controls one of the largest

00:00:23.441 --> 00:00:27.570
and most diverse land-based
missile forces in the world.

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:29.010
Details of the force are some

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:31.533
of China's most tightly guarded secrets,

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.788
but Western intelligence agencies

00:00:33.788 --> 00:00:37.890
and researchers have revealed
evidence of its dramatic rise.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.810
- China has rapidly increased
its missile arsenal.

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:47.697
This is a menacing challenge
to the United States.

00:00:47.697 --> 00:00:49.530
(upbeat music)

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.350
- [Host] In August, 2023,
Chinese leader Xi Jinping

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:54.570
suddenly ousted and replaced the head

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:57.690
of an opaque military unit
called the rocket force.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.580
China's leaders have tasked this force

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.203
with its highest military objective.

00:01:02.203 --> 00:01:03.840
(group cheering)

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.109
Preparing for a possible
invasion of Taiwan

00:01:06.109 --> 00:01:07.380
(bombs exploding)

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.265
and deterring the United
States from intervening.

00:01:10.265 --> 00:01:11.730
(man speaking foreign language)

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:12.570
- [Host] In recent years,

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:15.870
the force has test launched
hundreds of ballistic missiles

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:19.290
at a rate that has exceeded
the rest of the world combined.

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:21.030
Alexander Neal is a former defense

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:22.710
analyst for the British government.

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:27.710
- The PLA rocket force has
six bases spread across China

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:31.488
in an arc in the south,
which are responsible for

00:01:31.488 --> 00:01:33.900
a potential Taiwan conflict.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:37.113
Then up in the Northeast,
which is responsible

00:01:37.113 --> 00:01:39.240
for Korean Peninsula

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:41.400
and targeting Japan,

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.640
there's a dedicated base in central China.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:48.840
And finally, a base which
is responsible for the

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:51.270
northwest of China.

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.040
- [Host] On top of these six main bases,

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:55.320
which are numbered from 61 to 66,

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:58.290
the rocket force also has
several supporting bases,

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:00.903
one of which is regarded
as the most important.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:05.400
- Base 67 is the most secretive

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.400
of the PLA rocket force basis.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:12.434
The guardian of China's
strategic nuclear deterrent.

00:02:12.434 --> 00:02:13.770
(soft music)

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:16.260
- Little is known about
the base in Baoji City

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:18.660
in central China, but bunkers dug into

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.790
the Qinling Mountain
Range on the outskirts

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:22.800
of the city houses most of China's

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.600
nuclear warheads stockpile.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:29.520
- From Base 67, the warheads
subsequently distributed

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:33.305
by rail all across China,
northwest, northeast,

00:02:33.305 --> 00:02:37.050
and into the south, across
the brigades responsible

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:40.442
for launch and deployments
of the nuclear deterrent.

00:02:40.442 --> 00:02:42.240
(upbeat music)

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:44.010
- [Host] Bases in China's north are tasked

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:46.433
with maintaining nuclear capable
intercontinental ballistic

00:02:46.433 --> 00:02:50.160
missiles focused on
targets on the US mainland.

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:53.790
- A number of scientists
looking at civilian imagery

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:58.675
spotted three new missile
silo fields under development.

00:02:58.675 --> 00:02:59.760
(soft music)

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:04.760
The silo fields are based
in very deserted areas

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:09.030
outside of Hami, Yumen
City and Ordos City.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:11.970
- [Host] Silos are built as
circular tubes into the ground

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:14.790
and contain propellants
to launch missiles.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:18.150
- You can see here the Ordos silo field,

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:22.290
which is typically made up
of about 100 silos here.

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:23.787
An important aspect

00:03:23.787 --> 00:03:27.630
of silo fields is something
called a shell game.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:32.630
You might have 100 silos, but
you may fill only 50% of them,

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:35.910
and the adversary has to calculate which

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:39.600
of those silos are armed in
order to make a calculation

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.070
for a counterstrike.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:45.390
And a shell game is designed
to keep the adversary guessing

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:49.350
and also to reserve your own
number of warheads as well.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.210
- [Host] The construction in Ordos, Hami

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:54.030
and Yumen is thought to be
the most extensive buildup

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:57.150
of missile silos since the Cold War.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:00.690
If China mounts nuclear warheads
on missiles in these silos,

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.880
it will present a huge strategic shift

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.710
for US military planners.

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.663
- You can see here that the arc

00:04:06.663 --> 00:04:11.420
of the three silo fields is
designed to launch missiles

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.240
over the North Pole

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:17.700
and to the continental United States.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:20.130
- [Host] All this could give
Beijing the military capability

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:23.220
to deter Washington from
engaging China militarily

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:25.173
in the event of an invasion of Taiwan.

00:04:26.295 --> 00:04:27.570
(bombs exploding)

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:30.270
The rocket force recently
demonstrated its capability

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:32.790
to strike Taiwan during a conflict.

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:36.030
- Subordinate to Base 61 are a number

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:40.920
of brigades involved in
the targeting of Taiwan

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.930
during missile tests,

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:47.930
when Nancy Pelosi visited
Taiwan in August, 2022.

00:04:48.243 --> 00:04:49.740
(bombs exploding)

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:52.950
- [Host] China conducted several
days of military exercises.

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:56.940
- A number of short and
intermediate range missiles

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.911
were launched into exclusion zones

00:04:59.911 --> 00:05:02.040
to the north and south of Taiwan.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.590
One of them was to the east and seaboard,

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:08.490
and there were also some
short range rocket firings

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:11.253
between Taiwan and Fujian province.

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:13.530
- [Host] China has been building up

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:16.170
its missile capacity
near Taiwan for years,

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.240
but drills during Pelosi's visit

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:20.730
demonstrate the rocket
force's new capability

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:23.730
to target the entire periphery of Taiwan.

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:25.470
- These brigades are one

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.920
of the sharpest tools in their arsenal

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:32.580
to mount a devastating
missile attack on the island

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:37.080
to blockade the island to
close off shipping lanes

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.530
and to mount a stranglehold
on the island during times

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:42.393
of political sensitivity.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:45.870
- [Host] China views Taiwan's autonomy

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:49.770
and its links with the US as
a geostrategic vulnerability.

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:52.650
- So if we flip the map,
it depicts the challenge

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:54.390
that China is facing.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:57.450
It's hemmed in to some degree

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.430
by the first island chain,

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:03.330
and to a lesser extent by
the second island chain.

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:07.230
It's a dilemma of oceanic geography,

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:08.580
but in a military sense,

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:11.340
this is why the rocket
force is so important.

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.770
The rocket force would play a key role

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:17.100
to prevent intervention
of the United States

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:21.101
and allies were at war
to break out over Taiwan.

00:06:21.101 --> 00:06:22.380
(soft music)

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.720
- [Host] The Rocket forces
developed missiles capable

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:26.550
of striking US forces coming

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:30.720
to Taiwan's aid within the
first and second island chains.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.270
One of these is the Don Fang 26,

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:35.310
known as the carrier killer.

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:37.080
The weapon has been deployed to a number

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.810
of brigades posing a challenge to the US.

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:43.470
- The DF-26 can be either
conventionally armed

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.000
or nuclear armed.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.300
It can accurately target bases like Guam,

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.750
but it can also target an
aircraft carrier strike group.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:53.760
So this presents a major challenge

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.230
for United States in terms

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.409
of its counter intervention campaign.

00:06:57.409 --> 00:06:58.980
(bombs exploding)

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.050
- [Host] The Biden
administration has said US forces

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:04.173
will support Taiwan in the
event of a Chinese invasion.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:07.656
China's rocket force now
presents a serious threat

00:07:07.656 --> 00:07:10.080
to the US' ability to do that

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:12.720
dramatically raising the
stakes in any conflict

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:13.890
over the island.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:17.160
China's ministry of defense
did not respond to a request

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.134
for comment.

00:07:18.134 --> 00:07:20.717
(soft music)

